om/media/images/award_logo/1265/202205311743000470506.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Top Technology\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      PC Games Hardware\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Top Technology</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      Overclocking as cheap as for a long time\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>05/31/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B660-G GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Top Technology\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"PCGH 07/22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202205272021074810332.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Recommendation top class\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      hardwareinside.de\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Recommendation top class</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The workmanship and potential more than convinced us. The end user will be impressed and also surprised by what this small motherboard has to offer. Therefore, we are giving our top class award.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>05/20/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B660-G GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Recommendation top class\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareinside.de/asus-rog-strix-b660-g-gaming-wifi-im-test-66816/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1265/202202222026438900859.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Excellent Hardware\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      Hardwareluxx\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Excellent Hardware</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      An absolute recommendation thanks to BCLK-OC: ASUS ROG Strix B660-G Gaming WiFi in review.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>GERMANY</span> <span>02/21/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B660-G GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Excellent Hardware\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hardwareluxx.de/index.php/artikel/hardware/mainboards/58080-dank-bclk-oc-eine-absolute-empfehlung-asus-rog-strix-b660-g-gaming-wifi-im-test.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1272/202009301641179390635.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"HKEPC Recommended\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      HKEPC\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>HKEPC Recommended</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      It has a good power solution design and sufficient for motherboard connections and expansion functions. It is a few B660 motherboards that have added a Clock Generator chip and support Non-K OC overclocking.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>HONG KONG</span> <span>03/02/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B660-G GAMING WIFI Media review Award of HKEPC Recommended\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://www.hkepc.com/20902/%E6%94%AF%E6%8F%B4_Non-K_OC_%E7%9A%84_B660__ASUS_ROG_STRIX_B660-G_GAMING_WIFI?fbclid=IwAR320NURY_L6BmR6RMNwCy47VcLPjP9sJYNS_osmlHB227ghoGU66EVVLXk\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li><li class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardItem__qQut7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemTop__AQaLj\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__rewardImageBox__pTW-S\"><img  src=\"https://www.asus.com/media/images/award_logo/1252/202007020038072560922.png\" alt=\"\" aria-label=\"Great Value\" class=\"awardImage\"> <!----></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardMediaName__yE0u9\">\n      www.diit.cz\n    </p> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardName__jAstt\"><p>Great Value</p></div> <p class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardDescription__KhisN\">\n      The board worked as it should, I didn't encounter any strange errors, just some instability when clocking manually. It is nice that even the &quot;B&quot; board can stably operate DDR5 memory with a throughput of 6000 MT/s. I was pleased that in case of instability and repeated restarts, I never had to completely reset the board settings and I never lost the overclocking settings. So I could happily tune without any major frustration, which is not common.\n    </p></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottom__4mvlW\"><div class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemBottomLeft__4xC-s\"><span>CZECH REPUBLIC</span> <span>08/26/2022</span></div> <a aria-label=\"ROG STRIX B660-G GAMING WIFI Media review Award of Great Value\" tabindex=\"0\" href=\"https://diit.cz/clanek/recenze-intel-core-i5-12400f-asus-rog-strix-b660-g-gaming-wifi/zaverecne-hodnoceni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"ProductAwardsItem__awardItemMoreLink__pG7gP\"><span>Thêm</span> <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" data-name=\"圖層 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\" svg-inline alt=\"right\" role=\"presentation\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M23.07 13.77L9.06 0v6.7l9.18 8.94-9.18 9.66V32l14.01-14.49 1.87-1.87-1.87-1.87z\"></path></svg></a></div></li></ul></div> <!----></div> <!----></div> <div id=\"tabpanel-video\" role=\"tabpanel\" aria-labelledby=\"Video_review\" class=\"ProductAwardVideo__productAwardPagePadding__Z+Cw7\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__line__wNtmI\" style=\"display:;\"></div> <div class=\"ProductAwardVideo__videoWrapper__-NXix\"><div class=\"ProductAwardVideo